	"Name": "Vanilla Spouseroom NPC Furniture",
	"Author": "Asterisk555",
	"TagLine": "Adds the things in the vanilla spouseroom as furniture you can move around. Have a mod that replaces the spouseroom but you don't want to lose all their stuff? use this!",
	"Description": "_Descrption_\n\n*   \uFEFFAdds the things in the vanilla spouseroom as furniture you can move around. Have a mod that replaces the spouseroom but you don't want to lose all their stuff? use this!\n_Quick start_\n\n1.  Download and extract this mod and it's requirements into your mods folder (if you are confused check out\u00A0[this guide](https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Modding:Player_Guide/Getting_Started#Getting_started)\uFEFF).\n\n2.  It's ready to play\n_Other details_\n\n*   This is a duplication of files I made for\u00A0[customisable empty spouse rooms](https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/11641)\uFEFF, so you don't need this file if you have that one\n\n*   Krobus has his own\u00A0[NPC furniture pack](https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/11043)\uFEFF which can be used with this one\n\n*   I also have an extended\u00A0[Penny themed furniture pack](https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/10327)\uFEFF\n_Mods that work well with this one_\n\n*   [Buy 14 heart event furniture](https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/12956/)\uFEFF",
